            foot: 'Tomorrow: ×1.4 · claim within 48 hours to keep your streak.',
          }),
        }),
      ],
    },
    poll: {
      channel: 'events',
      caption: 'A live poll: vote with the buttons and the bars change, the way they do in Discord.',
      messages: () => {
